\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Repair quickly if your tone or method causes avoidable harm.\
\ls24\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Apply comparable standards across allies and critics.\
