\ls30\ilvl0
\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Is information being withheld because of a legitimate confidentiality or policy requirement?\
